---
// Testimonials: heading plus three quote cards.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Customer stories</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Loved by teams who would rather be working</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Small teams in design, engineering and operations use Halcyon to keep the week clear and the noise down.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <figure class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-8">
        <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M10 7H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3" />
          <path d="M20 7h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3" />
        </svg>
        <blockquote class="mt-6 flex-1">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg">We cancelled our Monday stand-up in week two. Everything we used to say out loud is already on the board, and nobody misses the meeting.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6">
          <img src="/media/avatar-1.svg" alt="Portrait of Priya Raman" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Priya Raman</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Head of Product, Northwind</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-8">
        <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M10 7H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3" />
          <path d="M20 7h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3" />
        </svg>
        <blockquote class="mt-6 flex-1">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg">Halcyon is the first planning tool my engineers did not ask to turn off. It tells you what matters today and then gets out of the way.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6">
          <img src="/media/avatar-2.svg" alt="Portrait of Tomás Herrera" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Tomás Herrera</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Engineering Lead, Kestrel</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-8">
        <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-brand-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M10 7H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3" />
          <path d="M20 7h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3" />
        </svg>
        <blockquote class="mt-6 flex-1">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg">Our clients can see exactly where their project stands without emailing us. That one shared timeline has saved our studio a full day every week.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-line pt-6">
          <img src="/media/avatar-3.svg" alt="Portrait of Amara Osei" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy" class="h-12 w-12 rounded-full object-cover" />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">Amara Osei</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted">Studio Director, Lumina</p>
          </div>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
